# geomoded SDK
 
This mod is the internal representation of **Geomoded SDK**. You can customize Geomoded's settings through this mod.

## About

**Geomoded** is a [Geometry Dash](https://store.steampowered.com/app/322170/Geometry_Dash/) mod loader and modding SDK with a modern approach towards mod development. Unlike previous mod loaders, which merely inject the DLLs and let devs handle the rest, Geomoded aims to be a more comprehensive project, which manages loaded mods & hooks itself. geomoded has been built to ensure compatibility, portability and ease of use while retaining performance. For devs, geomoded means easy development and portability; for end users, geomoded means an uniform and easy experience using mods.

## Help, Contributing, Etc.

If you need help using geomoded or would like to contribute, feel free to join our [Discord Server](https://discord.gg/9e43WMKzhp).

See [Documentation](https://geomoded-sdk.github.io/docs) for info about developing mods for geomoded.

